{"title":"Gem Topaz","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Dune Skirmisher</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-skirmisher\" title=\"Dune Skirmisher - Normal, 0.1% of recorded drops (1 / 936 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/dbfd07e1b3cf612d0e3f.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Skirmisher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.1%</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Share of logged loot events from this monster, not a per-kill chance.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"gem-topaz\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/gems\">Gems</a></p>\n      \n      <h2>Carats</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Carat\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/item/gem-topaz\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-topaz?q=0.5\">0.5c <span>26</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-topaz?q=1\">1c <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-topaz?q=1.5\">1.5c <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-topaz?q=2\">2c <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/gem-topaz?q=2.5\">2.5c <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/gem-topaz?q=3\">3c <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/gem-topaz?q=3.5\">3.5c <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/gem-topaz?q=4\">4c <span>2</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Gems come in half-carat steps from 0.5c to 4c. Up to 2c can be made at the witch, so those count as common; bigger ones only come from finds, and a 4c gem is very rare.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Carat</th><th>Rarity</th><th>Topaz found</th><th>Of all gems found</th><th>How you get one</th><th>In a ring (Binder)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-topaz?q=0.5\" title=\"Show the 0.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/03ef45d199ff9cf40c25.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.65)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">0.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>26 <span class=\"muted\">(53%)</span></td><td>60%</td>\n      <td>Gathering or monsters level 10+</td><td>Binder: stun, chill, root, hobble, and Corroded you inflict last ≈1.5% longer</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-topaz?q=1\" title=\"Show the 1c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/03ef45d199ff9cf40c25.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.70)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">1c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>8 <span class=\"muted\">(16%)</span></td><td>15%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 20+ or the witch (3 × 0.5c)</td><td>Binder: stun, chill, root, hobble, and Corroded you inflict last 3% longer</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-topaz?q=1.5\" title=\"Show the 1.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/03ef45d199ff9cf40c25.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.75)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">1.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>4 <span class=\"muted\">(8.2%)</span></td><td>10%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 30+ or the witch (3 × 1c)</td><td>Binder: stun, chill, root, hobble, and Corroded you inflict last ≈4.5% longer</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-topaz?q=2\" title=\"Show the 2c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/03ef45d199ff9cf40c25.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.80)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">2c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>4 <span class=\"muted\">(8.2%)</span></td><td>6.7%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 40+ or the witch (3 × 1.5c)</td><td>Binder: stun, chill, root, hobble, and Corroded you inflict last 6% longer</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-topaz?q=2.5\" title=\"Show the 2.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-good\" src=\"data/img/03ef45d199ff9cf40c25.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.85)\"><span class=\"q-name q-good\">2.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-uncommon\">uncommon</span></td>\n      <td>3 <span class=\"muted\">(6.1%)</span></td><td>3.5%</td>\n      <td>Gathering only</td><td>Binder: stun, chill, root, hobble, and Corroded you inflict last ≈7.5% longer</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-topaz?q=3\" title=\"Show the 3c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-excellent\" src=\"data/img/03ef45d199ff9cf40c25.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.90)\"><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">3c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-semi-rare\">semi-rare</span></td>\n      <td>1 <span class=\"muted\">(2.0%)</span></td><td>1.3%</td>\n      <td>Gathering only</td><td>Binder: stun, chill, root, hobble, and Corroded you inflict last 9% longer</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-topaz?q=3.5\" title=\"Show the 3.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-superior\" src=\"data/img/03ef45d199ff9cf40c25.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.95)\"><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">3.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-rare\">rare</span></td>\n      <td>1 <span class=\"muted\">(2.0%)</span></td><td>2.2%</td>\n      <td>Gathering only</td><td>Binder: stun, chill, root, hobble, and Corroded you inflict last ≈10.5% longer</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-topaz?q=4\" title=\"Show the 4c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-flawless\" src=\"data/img/03ef45d199ff9cf40c25.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(1.00)\"><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">4c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-very-rare\">very rare</span></td>\n      <td>2 <span class=\"muted\">(4.1%)</span></td><td>0.5%</td>\n      <td>Gathering only</td><td>Binder: stun, chill, root, hobble, and Corroded you inflict last 12% longer</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">49 Topaz recorded: 48 while gathering, 1 from monsters. “Of all gems found” is out of 372 gems of every kind. <a href=\"#/gemcombine\">Gem combiner</a></p>\n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/03ef45d199ff9cf40c25.svg\" alt=\"Gem Topaz\"></div><h3>Gem Topaz <span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">(1c)</span></h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>1 monster</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/9/2026, 10:44:58 AM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}